      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-11-12",
      "text": "The director said he is preparing a transition memo for the commission.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "-_32YWWsXRA",
        "ts": "2:56:41",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-17T07:30:07.868Z",
        "endTs": "2:57:11"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "Director hiring is a standing item on the regular agenda and can be discussed at the October meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "1:34:19",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z",
        "endTs": "1:34:51"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "November 23 was held for a possible special meeting to prepare for interviews.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "1:31:37",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z",
        "endTs": "1:32:07"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The group will hire a search firm and work with it to gather, screen and rank applications.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "1:10:08",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z",
        "endTs": "1:10:49"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The commission voted unanimously to create a temporary investigative group, a small team that works outside public meetings.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "1:10:02",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z",
        "endTs": "1:11:35"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The commission voted unanimously for an open application process.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "0:33:47",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z",
        "endTs": "0:34:22"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The director said the last search took about eight months.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "0:16:19",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z",
        "endTs": "0:16:49"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The job requires five years of law enforcement experience, three of them in administrative work.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "0:11:15",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z",
        "endTs": "0:11:45"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The deputy corporation counsel said the county rule calls for a hiring process open to any candidate.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "0:04:35",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z",
        "endTs": "0:05:09"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The director of the Department of Liquor Control announced his retirement at the commission's last meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "0:04:08",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z",
        "endTs": "0:04:38"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The Liquor Control Commission held a special meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "0:00:30",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z",
        "endTs": "0:01:02"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-09",
      "text": "A special meeting is set for September 21 at 1:30 p.m. to discuss how to find a new director.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "vp8RrdPVBC0",
        "ts": "1:40:09",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:59.641Z",
        "endTs": "1:41:02"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-09",
      "text": "The department director said he will retire, with December 31 as his last day.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
